# OpenTofu / Terraform - never commit working state or secrets
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
*.auto.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Plan output files - contain resolved variable values; never commit
*.tfplan
tfplan
plan.json
plan*.json

# Keep `.terraform.lock.hcl` committed for reproducible provider versions (see README).
